      "gate_output_tail": "$ python -c \"import grokking_optimizers.distributed\"  -> rc=0 (IMPORT OK)\n$ python tuning/flagship_distributed.py --help        -> rc=0 (usage + appended budget table)\n$ python tuning/flagship_distributed.py --dry-run --model decoder --gpus 8 -> rc=0\n  per-rank Nmax = 1,280,000  (== kDecMaxTensorNumel/TP = 1,280,000? YES)  [all 8 ranks]\n  per-rank resident params = 185,644,899  (of full 1,475,884,899)\n  opt=supergrok2 nCTA=64 ctas_per_pe=8  budget TOTAL=40.92 GiB (FITS)\n  NVSHMEM TP-team: PE range (0, 1, 8) (pure-TP-world=True); sym heap = 3,276,800 floats (13.1 MB)\n  CommCtx.tp_comm_handle = 0 (decode -> team 0); tp_team_n_pes=8 tp_team_local_pe=7\n  [dry-run] plan/mesh/TP-shard/budget/bootstrap validated for 8 rank(s); no kernel build/launch, no NVSHMEM init. Exit 0.\nRegression check: pytest -k \"parallel or distributed or zero3\" -> 30 passed, 2 skipped, 0 failed.\nNOTE: NO csrc edits (pure Python host code + new files), so the MANDATORY decoder TC SingleGPU path is byte-identical by construction.",
